<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id" />
  <para style="toc1">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc3">ROM</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Utakada u Bulus kurwa pa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Utakada una u sirya pa gya Bulus, bugyama bu Kristi Yesu, buna bu Hwinsu uba tanga bu san acuma a Yesu hinda aba unjane zwama ibwana i Hwinsu i burya̠ <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci laco cina acubago a Hwinsu uba ia̠ na suwa utakada u cikarigo ci Hwinsu <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />cikarigo cini ci burya̠ cisa ci Bwa bu buba, buna buza ikanga i buwama buna busa azwaga a Dauda, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ama zwama a̠huru an Hwinsu a nagu ciri, na koce u yaje bu sa Bwa bu Hwinsu buna bu masinge pa aco a kwajo: Yesu Kristi buca bu yaba a buci. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Pa Kristi Yesu Hwinsu uba ci pan i burya̠ na yina ga̠ci ci sana acuma a Kristi, nga̠ gaci ci kula aco mu'ogo ka̠mu a yaje a laga. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Uni hinda ui tane ka̠mu na ga̠hi buna iyiwa na Roma, ga̠hi buna Hwinsu uba ui uga i san bu Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Na rubuci ka̠mu nuhin na yiwa na cinge ci Roma ana Hwinsu uba ka̠ri hinda sanga a sa aco uba:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">i burya̠ a Hwinsu na Buca̠ abuci na Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu Kristi dala a burya̠ na suwa u duro.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">ugoji na ahunda̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Na jigu, na yiwa na goji Hwinsu nimui zwama Yesu Kristi ka̠mu nuhin, zwama aco doone ka̱mu a yiwa na hoge itano i suwa nihin.<verse eid="ROM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Hwinsu u daki an ina gya ni yiw a na zwamaga isa kamahinda, na Hwinsu numui una u gya ni yiwa na lagana na suwa numui ka̱mu na i zwamago i cikarigo ci laco ci bwa bu bware. Hwinsu u daki na yiwa na mabutaryaga na ga̠hin, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />hon na gya ia̠ ahuda tonohon; Hwinsu na maka̠la̠ ma uba ui san gya kurya pa ga̠hin.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Zwama na sano na ginbo i hyanu nuhin, nga̠ gya na pan daje u uno u burya̠ u a̱huru una ui bu pan koce- <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />ina gya na ginbo na ga̠hi na gya ci ma banga hon uikan na iyajo nimui na ilagano i Yesu na nihin Yesu cima banga. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ahun namui, na i na nagu u cidaka, aza hon na gya na ka̱ri i kore pa ga̠hi ama aza ina i sa na gazga na koro nga̠ sa ka̱ri i kore pa aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Zwama na za uwonbe u tiganba na icwa nimui, ka̱mu na aco na za mahansa na ana za mahansa ana aza cidaka na ana za cidaka. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ube usan, gya na cimgagi i zwamga cikarigo ci laco pa aco na yiwa na Roma<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koce u cikarigo ci laco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Cikarigo ci laco ci sa i mu'eyan na gya, isa koce Hwinsu pa aco na yaje, na jigu Hayahudawa na aco na ai sa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Zwama cikarigo ci cibe nga̠ Hwinsu nga̠ Hwinsu uba tane aco na yina a burya̠ , zwama usa na jigu hal koro u ikundagu usa iyajo i suwa, nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen: &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu ia̠gu i burya̠ bu za i koji zwama i iyajo i suwa u buba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">I hacigago i suwa i Hwinsu pa aco magwata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Idabuwo i suwa i Hwinsu zata u zaro kuro pa magwata na iwo aco ana iwo aba a gazga i kamahinda na idaku. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Hwinsu ui pan ga sungurwa zwama ina aba daki na Hwinsu iza ciswinyi pa ba, zwama Hwinsu na icwa uba u cibe ga. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ina Hwinsu uba ia̠ dwoniya na koce uba, una uza ihogu, tun na jigu i ia̠gu i doone u cibe tibe na haisa ha aco; a pwan i gane ini kanmu pa ina Hwinsu uba ia̠. Zwama haruni aco aza huja! <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Zwama a daki Hwinsu, ama ai dakuwo nga̠ aba ai pan Hwinsu cilabe, ama ina iyiwa na suwa waba ai jidana ihyahinda hasuwa haba haza ihya na sicwa saba kwa ci'incu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />hinda a hin ana azi mahasa, ama asa aco nagu mahasa, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Hinda a sake izangacu i Hwinsumana maza kwadana hagunki mana ma nyaga na buwama mana mai kwada, hinda na hagunki hana ha nyaga na muwuno, na mukwacukwacu na sihwa na sikwadagi. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Zwama haruni Hwinsu uba pan ga na ia̠gu ibwana i ci'incu na maka̠la̠ ma cidana ci ciri na soo waba, na ikanga waba hinda ayiwa na ia̠ ibwana i mu'eyan sakani waba. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />A ringya cikarigowo ci Hwinsu ci kamahinda ci nyaga cibya, ayiwa na pan ina Hwinsu uba ia̠ cilabe sa Hwinsu buna bu jube a pa bu cilabe hal ihogu Amin. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Zwama a i haruni, Hwinsu u pan ga na maka̠la̠ ma haisa mana maza i mu'eyan. si'a si masamugai sare zwama i cidana. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Harbuni hinda na maka̠la̠ ma icwa waba ina i zake icwa waba, hinda aco cware acuri labtaga na si'a saba ina i kamaci bini na ina Hwinsu uba ia̠ aco cware ayiwa na ia̠ ibwana i mun'eyan, na haruni aba kulaga hukunci mana ma ia̠ daidai na ibwana i ci'incu yaba. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Zwama a wanji i daki Hwinsu, kwa Hwinsu usa aba ia̠ bicika u kawui zwama aba ia̠ ina i kamacuwa aba ia̠. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Hinda a sinji na iri tuwamba ina isawa i burya̠ na mugota na kodayi, na nagu u maka̠la̠ na suwa waba. a sinji na nagu maka̠la̠, na ihunu i icwa yaba, na huna, na rudu, na suwa ci'incu. asa aco zwamage zwamage, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />ayiwa na hacigaga ize aza maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu, ayiwa na uge ize i cidana, ayiwa na zangi icwayaba, ayiwa na ia̠ gimba aco na magwata, aza na lagan cikarigowo ci a'unga siba. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />asa aco nagu soo u burya̠ , aza na sinji silkawali, aza maka̠la̠, aza yama, <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />A daki ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen, aco na ia̠ iri dalo niya ai kwaji ka̠mu buna bu i iru na ibwana bu gyamaci bu kwada, ama sa a yiwa na ia̠ haruni kawui, halma ayiwa na kala aco na yiwa na ia̠ haruni.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Shari'si Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Zwama haruni, anhun namui, si i egyi aco shari'a iza ina i sana ga̠hi egyi aco shari'a ko tibai iyi, zwama si i egyi aco shari'a, zwama ina aco aba ia̠gu hinda ga̠hi ia̠gu iri ini bu huno icwa nibui. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ci daki ana Hwinsu ui gwamacuwo nga̠ uba ia̱gi aco na ia̠gu iri ini shari'a na kamahinda. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />ma ga̠hi a'usa na mui, i ia̠gu ini isa burya̠ ina ga̠hi si ia̠ aco man wa shari'a, bu nga̠ ana bui sire shari'a si Hwinsu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ko nabiya si i yagage Hwinsu i burya̠, na nagu ui i hacigagu ui suwa ina Hwinsu uba ui cibai, i daki, ubwobo u soo u Hwinsu u gimbago isana i curi eewo, <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama zwama nagu i hugo nubui na daru u suwa, bu yiwa na numi icwa ni bui i hacigagu i suwa i Hwinsu huna uba ui ciba shari'a. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Zwama Hwinsu &lt;&lt;Ui pan tigamba daje kanmu na buba egyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Aco na yiwa na gimbo izangacu na gimbo u cilabe na egu i burya̠, na ina za mahacigaga, Hwinsu ui pana ga a̠huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ama acagiya aco a kanri sicwa saba a wanje ina si kamahinda hinda a laga ina isa burya̠, iri aco ni Hwinsu ui cibaga i hacigagu i suwa uba. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Aco na ia̠gu eewo sungurwa na nagu ihugo laco ui sana: na jigu hay ahudawa, na aco na ai sa ha Yahudawa; <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />ama aco na ia̠gu i burya̠ Hwinsu ui pana ga izangacu ga u pa ga cilabe na dala a burya̠: na jigu Hayahujdawa, na aco na ai sa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Hwinsu ui sa nga̠ buco u cibai maka̠la̠ ma icwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Aco na ai sa Hayahudawa hinda aza cikarigo ci musa a i magwata hinda a inagi zwama nagu u cikarigo ci musa, Hayahudawa ha za cikarigo ci Musa ha ia̠ magwata̱ hinda ai ia̠gya ga shari'a pa cikarigo ci Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Zwama sa i hugago cikarigo ci Musa ci sa aco i na burya̠, ama zwama i ia̠gu ina cikarigo ci Musa ciba hyen ana ia̠. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Aco na ai sa Hayahudawa aza i cibagu i cikarigo ci Musa kanmu na haruni a ia̠gu ina cikarigo ci Musa ciba hin ana a i, sa i nga̠ ha suwa haba haba hyin ana haba i, ko nga̠ ba aza cikarigo ci Musa, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />ina uba ia̠ga i cibe ana icibago i Musa i yiwa na suwa haba, hasuwa haba ha cibai ana ina isa kamahinda zwama aza huna hasuwa haba hasa ha cibai ana ai ia̠ga na burya̠ u cyagiya hya hinda ana i na burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Zwama haruni nga̠ aba zwamage na cikarigo ci laco harbuni uba ui sana huna u Hwinsu uba ui egya aco shari'a ina aba ia̠gu na cisunyi pa Bwa bu buba Yesu Kristi<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hayahudawa ana icibagu i Musa</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Baniya goo, bu yiwa na uge icwa nibui ana busa bu Yahudawa; i kumgage i cibagu i Musa hinda i yiwa na ia̠g cikibi ana i yiwa tare na Hwinsu; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />i daki ina Hwinsu uba gimba i ia̠ hinda i hug ina i cibaguji Musa uba hyin ana i tanga ina isa burya̠; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />i daki an si cewa a sihin ana i sana bucibago burubu, i sana hinda cingero pa aco na yiwa na ci'incu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />bun a buyiwa na cibago aco na aza mahasa, walami u saawo si nuya, sina si dakuwo ihya zwama pa i cibagu ci Musa iza ina sana ci daka na isa kamahinda- <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Guwo , buna , bu yiwa na cibaga cyagiya aco, bu yiwa na cibaga icwa nibuya? guwo buna bu cibago ana ata ia̠ ihya bu ia̠gu ihya? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Guwo buna bu hyen ta gimbaga si'a bu gimbago si'a si mainwa? Guwo buna bu zangi ina isa Hwinsu, si ta ia̠g ihya na suwa muginga? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />ga̠hi buna i yiwa na ia̠ga irugu na cikarigo ci Hwinsu, si ta ia̠g i mun'eya pa nagu i lagano i cikarigo ci Hwinsu? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Inga aba rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu;&lt;&lt;Zwama ga̠hi Hayahudawa aba hacigage iziya i Hwinsu pa aco ai sa Hayahudawa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Si laga cikarigo ci, Musa kaciya a kahin kai sana ka burya̠ ama si i wunje lagan icibago i Musa ui sana nga̠ ai ia̠guwa kaciya. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Sa aco na ai sa Yahahudawa a kumgage icibago ci Musa, az ai zangiga nga̠ aco na aza kaciya? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Hinda ga̠hi hayahudawa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa abe ai huna zwama i wonje ia̠gan i cibago i Musa, ko nga̠ iza cikargo . <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Zwama Buyahude bu kamahinda bui sa Buyahude pa ikanga i buba kawai, hinda kaciya ka kamahinda kai sa ka ikanga ko igunju i utaka usumo <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ina aba gimbo, Bayahude bu kamahinda bu sa Bayahude na soo, hinda Kaciya kamahinda kasa kaciya ka suw wata, ina a̠huru Hwinsu una i, sa pa i cibgo ina aba rubuci. Iri i buco buni Hwiinau u buya ui yabi byau sa awuma.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ea burya̠ Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />To unba anpani u ga̠hi i za, una u ga̠hi i zwamago na ga̠hi isa yahudawa? ko unba anpani u ga̠hi iza ui igunju u usumo nuhi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Aza tanba yina Hwinsu u pan ga cikarigo ci uba koro pa hayahudawa. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ama sa cagiya aco a wonje i ciba nagu u itana soo? Uni ui ciba na Hwinsu ui ciba ga nugu iyadwo i ba? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ko cimu! Dole Hwinsu u san u kamahinda, hinda tiganba buco bu cibya. Inga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Zwama a yaje na cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci uba zwamage</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">cisa kamahinda, ata bu kunba na magwata sa a kore na bu byana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ama sa ci yiwa na dala a eewo i sana i burya̠ Hwinsu na burya̠ pa? ci hyen na Hwinsu u ia̠ iwo buniyo sa u ci sungoleye? (Makabo man tiganba buba bui ia̠ga amani.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ko cimu! Sa harbuni, neya Hwinsu uba ui ia̠gya aco doone shara'a? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Sa nagu ui ia̠gu i burya̠ ui san cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci san kamahinda hinda ci jidane izangacu i ba, Bai i sana aba na hone gya hal kabaniya buco bu magwata̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Sa harbuni, ci ali na ia̠gu magota nga̠ ub ui ci sanana yina ai ia̠gu i burya̠ nga̠ cagiya aco aba si hin, &lt;&lt;Ci mu ia̠ je iwo nga̠ gaci ci hyan i burya̠&gt;&gt;? Ai hone ga zwama u egyi ga.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza buna busa bu burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />To neya gaci ci hyen? Gaci buna cisa Hayahudawa ci zake aco na aisa Hayahudawa? ko cimu! Na rigyano na cibo Hayahudawa na aco na ai sa Hayahudawa kanmu waba asa aco magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Inga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Aza buna bu za magwata̱ ko buikan;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />aza buna bu za mahansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">bu ginbage Hwinsu,<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ka̠mu waba a pan Hwinsu kacuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kanmu waba a bure;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">aza buna bu yiwa na ia̠ i burya̠,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">ko buco buika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Cikarigo ci uno waba cisa izi ina i gonje; hinda sire saba kwa iwugu i cibya.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Cikarigo ci uno waba nga̠ maganri ma ukuba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Uno waba u sinji na ciconwo na cikarigo ci wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Sa cimgagi icumu na ijigu mahya; <verse eid="ROM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />ka̠mu ihuga ina aba laga kwa zwama ui ihono na ihacigago, <verse eid="ROM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />ai dakuwo dala a burya̠.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />&lt;&lt;Aza iwas i Hwinsu na haisa haba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Baniya ci daki kanmu ina i yiwa na cikarigo ci Musa, a ia̠ ca zwama aco na yanse pa ciba, uni a ia̠ ca zwama aco ta hyan yina a sero hinda a cibe na doone kanmu u yiwa na dala shara'a si Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Zwama haruni aza buna aba ai hyen busa bu burya̠ zwama bu lagano cikarigo ci Musa, ina cikarigo ci Musa ciba ginbo, na ci daki na kanmu ci ia̠gu magwata̱.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inga aba ci kimga na Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama baniya yina an Hwinsu uba kimga aco pa uba a cibe yina ani, aza ina i gami yina aniyo na cikarigo ci Musa, ko nga̠ icibago i Musa na acubago Hwinsu a panga sheda u ciba. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Hwinsu u san aco yina a burya̠ pa i yajo yaba na Yesu Kristi Hwinsu u ia̠ haruni pa aco na yaje kanmu na Kristi. Aza ina i san an ai sa bikan, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />aco kanmu a ia̠ magwata̱ hinda a mere icagago i Hwinsu, <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ama zwama daje u i burya̠ i Hwinsu u ci tane na yina a burya̠ zwama Kristi Yesu ana a cagage ga daje. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Hwinsu u cuta Kristi a hone bo, zwama mahya ma boba masa yina u icagago i magwata̠ si aco ama tana suwa pa bware. Hwinsu u ia̠ haruni zwama u cibe an usa u burya̠, na haya hana ha ali u curi magwata̱ ma aco man ma aba ia̠ ui sugolewa ga- <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />u ia̠ zwama u cibe i burya̠ i ba baniya, zwama uba na icwa i ba usa u burya̠ hinda ube ui kimgana aco na a tane suwa na Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Bai, gaci ci ia̠ cikibi? Ko na ihya. Hinda bai i sana ina gaci ci i ini? Ko zwama gaci ci laga cikarigo ci Musa? Sa harbuniyo, Ama zwama ci tane suwa Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Zwama gaci ci rigyano ci yajo na buco bu yina buika na Hwinsu sa bu yaje na Yesu, sa pa ilagano i icibago i Musa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ko Hwinsu usa u Hayahudawa kawai? Ui sa Hwinsu u aco na ai sa Hayahudawa? Usa mana, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Hwinsu usa uika, hinda ui kimgana Hayahudawa na icwa i ba pa tano i suwa waba, hinda ui kimgana aco na ai sa Hayahudawa zwama iyajo i haba. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Uni u cibe na ci curi icibago i Musa zwama iyajo nici? Sa harbuni, ko cimu, kwa di cima jidane ikumgaga i cibago Musa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Misali u itano i suwa u Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Beya ga̠ci ci hin na Ibrahim, ina isa buca bu sikaka asici, baiya bware buba hoge na zwama uni? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Sa Ibrahim i hin dala a burya̠ zwama i burya̠ na bware buba ia̠, bware bu hya ina buba bui ia̠ cikibi-ama sa pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim i yaje na Hwinsu, hinda zwama i tano i suwa i bware, Hwinsu u rubi bware na bu za magwata̠.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Buco buna bu ia̠ ibwana ai cupe bwa ibwaza i bwana i buba, ui sa daje, ama ina kamace. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ama aco na pan kuce waba pa itano soo na Hwinsu una ui san aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu a guzagi ga a maringiya aza magwata pa uba, ai zangi i burya̠ buco buni nga̠ i burya̠ buba bini. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Harbuni Dauda uba zwamage na i burya̠ aba ia̠gi buco buna Hwinsu uba hyen na busa buco bu burya̠ , sa tare na ibwana ina buba ia̠gi: <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;I burya̠ isa i buco buna aba curigagi bo iwo i buba hinda buna magwata̱ ma buba aba yape bo. <verse eid="ROM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />I burya̠ isa buna Hwinsu uba za irutaga usa magwata̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />I burya̠ ni na Dauda aba ia̠ cikarigo ci ba isa kawai ya aco na aba gunji usumi, ko nabiya aco na aba ai gunjuwo usumi? ai ina gaci ciyiwa na zwamaga ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim i tane suwa na Hwinsu ube aba tane bware pa aco burya̠ . <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Binba ini iba egyi? nga̠ aba gunji ibrahin usuma ko kapi aba gunji? Ai kapi aba egyi bware. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ama a egyi bware ina aba ai ganiya pa igunji bware usuma, ina i cibe i burya̠ i buba zwama itano i suwa u bware tun lokaci una aba ai sa gunju bware usuma. Ibrahim ibe isa buca aco na a yaje na Hwinsu hina a ce ga nga̠ asa aco burya̠ pa bware, ko sa ai gunju ga usuma. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Bware bube bu sa buca bu aco na aba gunji ga hasuma, sa ma igunju i hasuma kamuiyo ama aco na laga mupunje mu itano suwa i Ibrahim kapi aba gunji bware usuma.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alkawari a Hwinsu ai hyan pa itano i soo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nga̠ Hwinsu uba zwama Ibrahim na azwaga a bware an doone ui san u bware, u ia̠ haruni, sa zwama bware buba laga icibago Musa, ama zwama bware bu yaje hinda zwama itano i soo i bware pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ama sa aco na yiwa na lagana icibago i Musa abe ai gada doone, to itano isuwa isa i kamui hinda alkawali a Hwinsu ai jidanuwa ihya, <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Icibago i Musa si kuleya ubobo u suwa u Hwinsu. ama ihuga ina iza icibago i Musa aza ihyan nagu ui lagano i cikarigo ci Musa. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Zwama haruni alkawali ani a yinsa pa itano i suwa, nga̠ uba ui sana nga̠ daje pa i burya̠ i Hwinsu ka̠mu pa saawo sa ibrahim-sa kawai aco na a yaje na icibago Musa, ama aco na kanmu a yaje na ina ibrahim iba yaje naba. Zwama ibrahim ibe isa buca a buci ka̠mu. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Inga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin: &lt;&lt;Na bu sano buca mu'ogo dinyiya.&gt;&gt; Busa buca abuci pa Hwinsu, buna aba yaje na buba-Hwinsu una sa pan aco akwajo a̠huru hinda sa hyen i ia̠gi hinda i ia̠. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ko nga̠ uba sa itano i soo u ibrahim nga̠ usa kamui, ka̠mu na uni bware burya̠ gaba na i tano i soo, hal bware bu sa buca bu sizwaga dinya nga̠ aba hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Harbuni sizwaga a sebo siba si san.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ibrahim iba na haya dari uikan, itano i suwa u bware ui duruwo ko nga̠ buba hyan ikanga i bware i konbe cu'onga na hinda bu'a bu bware Isaratu iza ipwanakana i mace saawo. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Itano i soo i buba i curu bware na alkawali ana Hwinsu uba ia̠gi bware, itano i soo i bware i jidane bware koce kwa buba ne pana Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Bware bu daki na Hwinsu ui sinji cikarigo cina uba egyi bware. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ube usan aba hin &lt;&lt;Na itano i soo Ibrahim isa i burya̠ pa bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Cikarigo cina aba hin, &lt;&lt;A ce bware nga̠ bu burya̠&gt;&gt; Sa bware bubabuba aba zwamage bware. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ama a hilange cikarigo cini zwama ga̠ci nga̠ ga̠ci ma ai ci ca aco iburya̠ aco na a yaje Yesu buca bu yaba a buci buna Hwinsu uba asenge pa aco a kwajo. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Zwama a hone Bware zwama magwata̠ a maci hinda a asenge bware zwama bu ci kimga na Hwinsu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Dala a burya̠ na Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Baniya nga̠ Hwinsu aba tano pa nagu u magwata zwama i tano i suwa, ci hin dala burya̠ na Hwinsu zwama buca bu yaba Yesu Kristi, <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />pa bware gaci hin dala a burya̠ ana gaci yiwa na itano i suwa naba baniya. Hinda baniya ci yiwa na cikibi na itano i suwa na ci sana pa aco na izangacu i Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Sa harbuni kawai, ama ci yiwa na hoge laco pa sungoro una gaci yiwa na uba hinda sungoro ui kole duro ui ikoko; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />i ia̠ koce ui ikoko, si kuleya gama u suwa; gama u suwa, si u kuleya itano i suwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Itano i soo iza i koleya ihacigago i soo, zwama Hwinsu u ci hala maka̠la̠ ma uba nga miya ma ujaba na hasuwa a haci na a̠huru u ba, una uba ci pan. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Tun gaci aco magwata an ai dakuwo ina i ia̠ na gaci, Kristi a kwaji zwama aco magwata. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Aza buna bui pwana ikwaji zwama buco bu burya̠, ko nga̠ uba sa a pwa i hyan buna bui ia̠ koce ui ikoko bu kwaji zwama buco bu burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Hwinsu u ci cibe iri u maka̠la̠ man uba ci kanri:Tun gaci aco magwata̱, Kristi a kwaji zwama gaci. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Na mahyan ma bware aci kimga na Hwinsu; baniya, ai ci cagaga pa i hacigago i suwa i Hwinsu zwama bware! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ci sanse aco na ai kanruwo Hwinsu, ama u ci misi si'osa si ba zwama ikwaju i Bwa bu ba, nga̠ aba ci kimga na Hwinsu, ai ci cagaga zwama cihano ci burya̠ ci Bwa buba buniyo! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ama sa ka̠mu buniyo, ama ci ia̠ wanwo na Hwinsu zwama Bwa buba Kristi Yesu, zwama pa ba gaci hyin ikimugano na Hwinsu hal ci sa si'osa ba.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Inga magwata̱ mab ma ese doone pa buco buikan harbuni hinda u'o zwam magwata̱. Ube sa u'o ub laga tuhonb zwama aco kanmu a ia̠ magwata̠ <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Magwata̱ ma yanse na doone kafi a pan icibago i Musa, ama ihuga ina i za icibago, aza i rubi icibago i Musa. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ama koro u lokaci u Adamu hal koro hon Musa, u'o u yanse na ia̠gya aco cugwama, ko aco na ai ia̠gu magwata̱ nga̠ Adamu aba ia̠ man ma ba nga̠ bware buba wonje ilagana ina Hwinsu uba hyen na bu ia̠, a ia̠ kwataci wa Adamu na buna bu yiwa na koro. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama daje una u Hwinsu uba pan ui sa uika na una buna bu yiwa na koro na nagu ui lagano i Adamu aba ia̠, ama yama Hwinsu i zaki uni kanmu dinyiya, harbuni hinda daje u ba pa aco dinya zwama yama buco buika, Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Daje u Hwinsu ui nyaganuwa na magwata ma buco buika: shara'a sina si laga magwata̱ mikan masa u'o, ama daje una Hwinsu uba pan mabe ma i kaji shara'a man maza magwata̱ pa Hwinsu ko nga̠ uba sa ci ia̠ magwata dinyiya. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Usa kamahinda na iso u magwata̱ ma buco buika u'o uba hina na ia̠ cigwama ci doone zwama buco buika, ama igwame ini aza i gama na ina i buco buikan buba ia̠,Yesu Kristi. Wata yama na aba ce dinyiya tare na daje i burya̠ una ui ia̠ cigwama pa buco buika, Yesu Keisti. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Inga magwata̱ mab buco buikan ma hone aco ka̱mu, harbuni hinda i ibwana i burya̠ i buco buikan ui san a curi aco kanmu hinda a pan ga a̠huru. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Nga̱ aco dinya sane aco magwata̱ zwama nagu ui lagano i buco buika, harbuni hinda zwama i ia̠gu i burya̠ i buco buika Hwinsu ui kimgana aco dinya i lagano i buco buika. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ina san aba es na icibago i Musa zwama a jidane i ia̠gu eewo, kwa yama Hwinsu na majidane moso, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />nga̠, magwata̱ mab zwame na u'o, harbuni yama i Hwinsu i ia̠ cigwama pa yina a i burya̠ una ui ci kula pa a̠huru ana aza ihogu na i lagano i Yesu Kristi buca a buci.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">U'o na magwata wasegewa na Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Beya gaci ci hin? Ci ali na ia̠gu i magwata̱ nga̠ yama Hwinsu iba i majidana monso? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ko cimu! Gaci buna ci kwaji na magwata̱ neya gaci ala na ia̠gu i magwata̱? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />I dakuwo na ga̠ci buna aba ci ia̠gi baptisma kuro pa Yesu Kristi aci ia̠gi baptisma kuro u'o u Bware? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Wata aci wunba na bware pa baptisma hinda ci so u'o tare na bware, zwama nga̠ aba asenge Kristi pa aco kwajo na koce izangacu i buca, harbuni gaci ci yan na a̠huru anpu. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Nga̠ ga̠ci ci sa buika na u'o u Kristi pa baptisma, na harbuni hinda gaci ci yana buika pa wasengewa u Bware. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Zwama ci daki an a wunbano ikanga nici i gose tare na Kristi nga̠ aba jukai bware zata u'on u masacu nga̠ aba ai hacigaga koce u ikanga i magwata, nga̠ ga̠ci ciza i sanakana gyama a magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Sa ci kwaji aci cagage na koce u magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Inga gaci kwaji tare na Kristi, ci daki na ci yana tare na Bware. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ci daki na Kristi a masenge pa aco kwajo, Bware buza i kwadakana; u'o uzawa koce na Bware. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />U'o una Kristi aba ia̠, magwata̱ maza koce na Bware; hinda baniya i yano ina i buba yiwa,a yiwa tare na Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Harbuni ga̠hi ma, ima zangi nga̠ i kwaji na magwata̱ ama i masenga pa Hwinsu tare na Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Zwama haruni ita yada magwata̱ ma ia̠ cugwama na mukanga a muhin mu magwata̱ muna mui kwaji hal ma mu san i laga maka̠la̠ ma i doone. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ita cutan hasala ha mukanga a hahin pa ibwana magwata̱ zwama i ia̠ mugota, ama ina ga̠hi i ia̠ pan je sicwa a sihin pa Hwinsu, nga̠ aco na a sera pa u'o kuro iyano; cutan ikanga nihin pa bware nga̠ icwana i burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ita magwata̱ ma ia̠ koce na ikanga nihin, zwama i zawa na i icibago i Musa, ama pa yama.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agyama i burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Baiya? Ci re gaba na ia̠ga magwata̱ zwama ci za pa icibago i Musa ama na yama Hwinsu? Aye ko na cimu! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Cikarigo ci kamahinda i daki na sa bu pan icwa nabo pa buco nga̠ cigyama, bu sano bugyama pa buna bu go bu laga bo- ko bui san bugyama pa magwata̱ una ui kule u'o ko una ui kimgan na Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama goda Hwinsu, zwama bu sanse bugyama bu magwata̱, bu laga na suwa nobo kanmu ci cibago cina ci go bu ce kanmu. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Abu cagage daje pa magwata̱ hinda busa bugyama bu i burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ni yiwa na ia̠gya cikarigo nga̠ buco buba sa bu ia̠gi zwama nagu u koce nuhin. Inga na jigu ga̠hin i sabe i cuta ikanga nihin pa ibwana ciri na ina isa zangacu i Hwinsu, harbuni baniya icuta sicwa a sihin pa ia̠gu i burya̠ zwama nga̠ ga̠hin i laga Hwinsu kanmu. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Inga go bu sase bugyama bu magwata̱, i burya̠ i yanuwa na bu lagana. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Unba riba u bu hin na i ia̠gu ina go baniya bu yiwa na hoge muyan mui ia̠gu iba baniya? Ini kanmu sa kuleya u'o! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama baniya a bucagago pa magwata̱ hinda isa agyama a Hwinsu ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Zwama magwata̱ masa ma koleya-u'o, ama daje u Hwinsu usa a̠huru ana aza ihogu pa Kristi Yesu buca bu yaba a buci.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />ga̠hi idakuwa, ahun nimui zwamu na yiwa na ia̠ cikarigwo na naco na za cidaki cikarigwo ci Hwinsu hinda adaki icibago ci Musa ci Hwinsu ciza kuce pa tagamba kamu buna buyiwa na muhug? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kwatanci buna, cikarigwo ci Hwinsu dole bu a bucige buyiwa na karkashi bware buba nga̠ buba buyuwa na muhujo, amma si bware bu kwajo, to bu'a buniya buzama na karkashi a shari'a bu paw iye cicagiya cigna. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Hida, si jidani ia̠ cigya na bucagiya buco bu cware hinda bware buba bui sikwajuwo, i ugana bua buniya akaruwa. Ama si bware bu kwajo to sa cidana buba buyuwa na ia̠ga, ko dama si bu ia̠gi cigia nabu cwagiya buco. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Zwamu haruniya, ahun namuya ga̠hi ma i kwadago na suwa we ikanga, Yesu kristi, zwama ga̠hi i yana tare, buna Hwinsu uba asingiya pa u'o, zwa gace ci ilage ko cimata nange ko cikuliya saawo pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Lokaci ana magota maba yanse, na cisange na egyi eewo, na ia̠gu i henagu ina sisah ama gwatage na cikarigio ci Hwinsu isah ikanga i egyi iwo, zwama gacei matange saawo si u'oh. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ama baniya, na kwaju na ina cigamiya aci curuwo na paro ya icibago a Musa zwama gaci pa Hwinsu cilabe na cipawpow na a̠huru a bware, sa anga aba yase na da.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">doka na magwata̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Baiya gaci zwame, baniya? dokoki usa magwata̱? kamahinda aye! kamahinda sa harubuni naza idaki ina sa magwata̠ kwa nga̠ hadokoki aba a kure. hinda naza daki ina i sana kamahinda si zwama ha dokoki ha hyen, &lt;&lt;ibuzaihugana ibuciy he&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Amma magwata̱, ma hye dama zwama ha dokoki, kwa nimui na dama kamo tutane i eewo, sisa zwama ha dokoki to magwata̱ maiza iyana, magwama kwajo. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Inga ga̱ci sa na dala na nagu hadokoki; ama nga̠ hadokiki ha kurwa magwata̱ na sana dala burya̠ na dala igwaju. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Na hadokoki, hana hasa nga̠ dala hana haza ihogu, ama na dako has ikwaju. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Magwata̱, mazangi dama zwama ha dokoki, kwa na kulgana, nabiya ge na kwaji. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Harubuniya, enkarigiow ci Hwinsu ciza ciri, hinda ha dokoki ha za ciri, hasa ha burya̠ na gama hinda. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Shin ina yase burya̠, hind, iba nasana u'oh a hummuye? dalili uzah! ama zwamu adaki magwata̱ na fele na asa magwata̱, hind san muche u'oh pa ahwamui zwama ina yasa gama, zwama pa hadokoki magwata̱ maba mai sani ciri nabure. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Cidaki na hadoki hasa a huru, amma ge na siwa bu burya̠, nga̠ buca buna aba sange kurwo cigyama magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Gyapa na dakuwo ina gya na yiwa na egyi. zwamu ina gya na gimbo ia̠ga na ia̠go gya. Amma ina gye na wunje ibiya gye na yiwa na ia̠ga. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Hinda sa ni iyi ina gya na karuwa, to na yaje icibago i Musa dasa iye gama. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Inga ibayiwa, sa gyamui na cowa namuya na iyi magwata̱, ama magwata̱ mana yiwa na suwa namui abiya a iyi magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Na daki ko na iye burya̠ na yiwa na suwa nimmiya, zwamu gyamuya buniya, na suwa numa na kare ia̠ i burya̠, amma na ponuwa ia̠ga. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Zwamu ina gya si ia̠ga sa i gama gya na gimbo, aye, ia̠gi ina yasa burya̠ ibiya gye na yiwa, na ia̠ga. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Baniya sana i ina gya na karuwa wasawa magyamiya na ia̠gi, amma magwata̱ una uyiwo na dala na gya ubiya uyi magwata̱. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Zwamu harbiniya na bagi magwata̱ na bware: sina na gimbo ia̠gi i bware, magwata̱ mu yiwa tare na gya. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Na soo nimui hadokoki habiya ha yiwa na soo nimui. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ama na hyani ha cagiya hadokoki haba na ibwana na ikanga nimui, haba na ia̠ga gasa na hadokoki hana ha yiwa na soo nimui haba sana buco bu yaba ci'icu. ca icibago i Musa ha magwata̱ na bwana na suwa nimui. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nasa iru bwamba buma! gamba bui na caga nasawa wui kanga i'oh? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ci gojo Hwinsu-zwama Yesu Kristi bugwama buciya! zwamu haruniya, na soo numui nasa bugyama pa hadokoki ha Hwinsu, ama nai kanga naciya nasa bugyama bu hadokoki ha magwata̱.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Zwama haruniya, ikoju iza paco ana ayuwa na yesu kristi. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Zwama pa suwa u yesu kristi ha dokoki ha a̱huru haba na pa yanci pa magwata̱ na u'o <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Zwama ina hadokoki haba zanuwa kuce pa magwata̱ wai ubuma, Hwinsu uyi pa cumano bwua buba na kamani buco bu piso. kwa buba na hune magwata̱ pa bumma. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Zwama ina aba gimbago pa hadokoki haba sinji, buna bua yiwo dalana magwata̱ ama kwa nga̠ a huru aba gimbo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kama aco na yiwa na dala na magwata̱ mai kanga, suwa waba u yiwa pa ina ikanga iba gimbo, ama aco na yiwa na dala nga̠ a huru aba gimbo suwa waba uyuwa pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Soo buco bu magwata̱ usa u'o ama buna bu a̱huru aba kaju is rai na lafiya. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Soo buco bu magwata̱ buza shiri na Hwinsu. Zwam uza biyaya pa hadokoki ha Hwinsu, balle uba iyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Aco na magwata̱ u yiwa na malaka ga aza iye ko ipana Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Goo, baniya, a̠huru aba yiwa na gazga sa a̱huru magwata̱, sa huru a Hwinsu a yiwa na goo. kamu buna buza a huru Yesu Kristi, to buasa bu Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama si Yesu Kristi a yiwa na dala na ga̠hi, ko nga̠ ikanga nuhi i yiwa na yina a u'o zwam magwata̱, a̠huru a Hwinsu a yiwa na bu pan a̱huru zwama Hwinsu ci caga ci sana aco nagu ciri. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Sa a̠huru a Hwinsu ana a̠singai Yesu pa u'o a yiwa na dala na soo nuhi, to, Hwinsu buna bu a̠singai Kristi pa aco na a kwadaga bui pan a̠huru na ikanga nuhi ana ai kwaji pa a̠huru a buba ana yiwa na dala na soo nuhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Zwama harbuni a'usa nimui, ga̠ci ma ci za ina kamaci ga̠ci ia̠ ama sa dala a magwata̠. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Si bu yiwa na dala na magwata̠, bui kwaji, ama si bu yaje na bu i dala burya̠ buza ikwaji. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Zwam ka̠mu kamu ana yiwa lagana ina Hwinsu abu hya, to isana saawo si Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Zwama ya cewa a̠huru ana ga̠hi yana na cigyama. ko iwasa, ama i ce a̠huru asa saawo. pa bware gaci sihaneh, &lt;&lt;abba buca.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Ahuru a Hwinsu na icwa yaba tare na a̱huru nuci a san ga̱ci cisa saawo su Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Baniya susa cisa saawo, to cisa cihingici Hwinsu na Yesu Kristi sa ciyiwa na iso wuhala tare na burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nayuwa nai zangi wahala wa baniya uza na maruba na laco una yuwa na kurwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Na ia̠gu jigo yi i sana i apugage kura u saawo si Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Zwami najigo a iyiwa zwamu hacigago, sa zwamu maka̠la̠, ama zwamu buna bu ire uwa zwam bege. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Iyejigo na icwa yaba i bana a yanci hala huya ah pa yanci a burya̠ pa saawo saba. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Cidaki buna aba iyi najigo buyiwa ra cidaro pa paga umaco hal kabaniya. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Sa kauwiya, amma gaciya na sucow asiciye bune bui cicagaga. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Pa itanu soo aba cicagage, ama itanu isuwa ma aba henago yasa itanu i soo i gamba? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Si ci tana soo pa ina ga̠ci zaa, to ga̠ci abgage hal i kore. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Hinda harbuniya, a̠huru si ci baga pa ga̠ci ci mayagage. ca dakuwo nga̠ ga̠ci ci ia̠ ahunda̠, ama a̠huru na icwa yoba si i yiwa na ia̠ ahunda̠ zwam ga̠ci. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" /><verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Cidala ka̠mu Hwinsu si yana hia̠ ibwana pa aco burya̠ a na ka̠ri uwa hinda a ugaga nga̠ uba ka̱ri. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Zwamu Hwinsu a aci daki tun na jigu we kare suwo suba, zwama busa bua bu jigo pa ahun waba. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Aco na uba sana aco yaba abe uba u uga ana ubaga uga uguzagiga, uba hind cigwama. <verse eid="ROM 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Naiya, hinda, na zwama uniya? si Hwinsu u yiwa nagaci, gamba bui ci wunda? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Hwinsu una wa curuwo Bwa a buba, amma bu parbua zwama rucige kamu. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Gamba bui kaliya saawo acona Hwinsu uba tanga, hinda Hwinsu ube u sana aco nagu magwata pa sinu yaba. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Gamba buciya buhun na buco? Yesu Kristi, ana kwaji zata na ciya ana a macigiya paco a kwadago? baniya a yiwa ne wa ucuga u Hwinsu aba na cihyegi a hinda. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Gamba bui ci gazgana na maka̠la̠ ma Kristi kwa na buca hya, aza ko wahala ko imirow. ko nagu umere, ko nagu umere, ko hazuga? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Inga cikarigo ciba hilange, zwama nuhuya gaci istah uwoh, nga̠ hetamiya aba cizagi. <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Zwama na ini ka̱mu, ci zake aci uganya na aco nasara, zwam Kristi buna bo ci ka̱la̱ngi <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Zwam na yaji na soo nimui, ko u'oh, ko na yiwa na a̠huru, acuma a Hwinsu, ko a̠huru a eewo, ko bane ko muhun muna mu yiwa na korwo, ko nabiya koce hya. <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />Aza, ko na imeh, ko nabiya iheh na i pwan na ci hapsaga na maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu. ana yiwa na soo Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Hwinsu na aco na uba tanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Na yiwa na zwamaga kamahinda- na sa bu Kristi hinda sa cibya gya na yiwa na ia̠ga, na suwa ui ikoko nimui gya na yiwa na zwamaga una u a̠huru a Hwinsu a daki na kamahinda gya na yiwa na zwamaga- <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />sa na hyen na yiwa na su i hacigago i soo. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Zwama aco namui,isafo na mahyan a mimui aco nimui,wasa ma a hyen na an tane uno u wo zwama abe hal an hadgage na Kristi, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />asa aco Hwinsu, u san ga asa saawo si Bware hinda cibe ga cigwama ci u ba pa ba;Hwinsu u ia̠ kucuna na ba hinda u pan ga i cibago i cikarigo ci Musa,aza i pano i Hwinsu cilabe ci kamahinda, na akawali a Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Asa aco na aba daki an a sire pa sikaka si Hayahudawa ana asa azwaga a Kristi, nga̠ buco, Hwinsu una usa u yiwa na cugwama ci aco kanmu,a pana u cilabe! Harbuni. <verse eid="ROM 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Na hinwo na alkawali Hwinsu a ma yage.Zwama sa kanmu aco Israila asa aco Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ko hinda azwaga a Ibrahim asa saawo sa Hwinsu. Hwinsu u hyen na Ibrahim,&lt;&lt;Pa bwa a bubo Ishaku gya na sinji cikarigo a cimu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ina aba yiwa na genbo, wata saawo sina aba mace nga̠ aba ia̠gu cimaco, saawo sina aba mace na pa zwamago i Hwinsu sibe aba hyen si sa saawo sa azwaga a Ibrahim. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Zwama alkawali a Hwinsu a ia̠ ca harbuna: &lt;&lt;Na lokaci u burya̠ na maringe, hinda Isaratu i bu mace bwa bu cware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Sa ka̱mu buniyo, saawo sa Irabeka si sa buca buikan, wata Ishaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ama kafi aba mace sigilo sina, ko kafi siba ia̠ i burya̠ ko i wo, Hwinsu u zwama Iribkatu na, &lt;&lt;Buna busa bu lbe bui lagan buna noya&gt;&gt; Hwinsu u zwame kafi aba mace ga <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Hwinsu u zwame haruni zwama buna aba ai tangana ai tangana bwa pa ibwana i Hwinsu, sa zwama ibwana ina aba ia̠. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Inga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage: &lt;&lt;Na ka̱ri Yakub, na wonje Isuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />To bai gaci ci hin? An Hwinsu ui ia̠guwo na burya̠? Ko cimu! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Zwama Hwinsu u hin na Musa, &lt;&lt;Na ciba tiganba yama buna bu gya na ka̱ri yama, hinda na hugya yama buna bu gya na ka̱ri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Uni ui sa zwama i pwano i buco ko na i tano koce i buba, ama kwa di ihogo i yama i Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hyen:&lt;&lt;Na bu pa an go sa bugwama bu masar zwama bu cibe koce hinda gya cibe iziya nimui pa doone kanmu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Zwama haruni Hwinsu su cibe yama buna uba ginbo hinda sa u san da̠ri u suwa buna uba ginbo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihacigago i suwa u Hwinsu na yama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ama aza buna bui hin na gya: &lt;&lt;Sa harbuni bai i san Hwinsu uba hin na ga̠ci ci ia̠ga na burya̠ ? Ganba bui wonje i zwamo i Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ama go bu sa ganba, hal goo bui wonje cikarigo ci Hwinsu? &lt;&lt;Utako una uza i hin na buna bu ma un, bai san go buna ma haruna?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ai buna bu ma utaka̠ buza koce u buba bui ma utako nga̠ buba ginbo, buza koce i ia̠ga hatako ha menwa na cinge cina aba ia̠ na burya̠ hinda mucagiya pa ihya ina i jidanuwa ihya? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Hinda harbuni uba san kamahinda ina Hwinsu uba ia̠, u ka̱ri i ciba idabuwa i soo uba hinda u cibe koce uba a daki, ama suwa uba u duri pa aco na san on idabuwa i suwa-an a ka̱ri i ese yina a u'o? <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Hinda u ka̱ri i ciba i zangacu uba ina i yiwa tihonba ina uba ci hala gaci buna ci gazi na yama uba, ina aba shiri tuni zwama i zagacu uba- <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />zwama gaci cisa aco na Hwinsu uba tanga, sa pa hayahudawa kawai, ama aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Inga aba zwame na utakada u Hosiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Aco na ai sa &lt;namuiyo&gt; na ugan ga aco naui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">cinge cina ci gya na kanruwo na ugan ca &lt;Bu maka̱la̱ a mamu,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Hinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">na ihuga ina aba uga ga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;I sa aco namui,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">Apayi aba ai ugan ga saawo sa Hwinsu a̱huru.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Hinda Ishaya i zwamage na aco israila:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">&lt;&lt;Ko aco Israila a gagi na hega u wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">ai gana cimu waba aba ai cagag ga.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Zwama Hwinsu ui ia̠gya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">doone shara'a u za i hacigaga lokaci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Usa nga̠ Ishaya aba zwamage tuni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Sa Buco buyaba Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">wa ci ganuwa sezwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">sa aco ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">ca i sana nga̠ aco Sodom, ai cirenge nga̠ Gomara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nagu ui yajo u Israila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />To ci hin neya? Aco na ga̠ci hyan nga̠ ai dakuwo Hwinsu a yano na makimgana na ia̠ga i burya̠ zwama itano i suwa yaba; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ama aco Hwinsu Israila, ana yiwa na ginbo u icibago i Musa ai hyinwo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Be sa haruni? Zwama ai yisanuwa pa i tano i suwa kawai ama kanmu na ibwana. Hinda kwa aba na ia̠ jubuta na &lt;&lt;Utare u jubuta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Na iri Sihiyona tare u jubuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">na tare una ui san aco a hene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">ama buna bu yaje na bware bu za i hoge mu'eya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ahun nimui, ina suwa numu uba zake i ka̱ri na ahunda̱ nimui pa Hwinsu aco nimui a hin i cago. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Na daki na aza isibu i maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu dinya, ama maka̠la̠ ma ba mai sa ma mahansa ma ba. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Nga̱ aba ai dakuwo yina an a Hwinsu uba su san aco maringiya a burya̠ a yiwa na gimbo a i yina waba u burya̠ pa sinu a Hwinsu, uni ube u sana aba cuta icwa yaba asa aco i burya̠ . <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Zwama Kristi a be asa ihogu i icibago i Musainga kanmu buna bu yaje na Kristi ai kimgana bo na Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa u ia̠ cihenro na buna bu yaje na icibago i Musa:&lt;&lt;Buna bu laga bu za i kwaji.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ama ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage: &lt;&lt;Ta hyen na suwa nubo na &lt;ganba bui yindana zata u zaro?&gt; &gt;&gt;(Uni usa iringeewo i Kristi na cinge). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Ko hinda go hin, &lt;ganba bui kanzige imya pa ulambu una u zwambuci dinyiya. pa aco a kwajo?&gt; &gt;&gt;(Uni usa iringe i'o i Kristi pa aco a kwajo). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Beya cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin? &lt;&lt;Cikarigo ci yiwa ciyabu na ga̠hin; na sunbi na bui na suwa nuboi,&gt;&gt; cibe cikarigo ci kamahinda ci ga̠ci yiwa ia̠gya: <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Si bu zwame na uno nuboi na, &lt;&lt;Yesu asa Buca bu tebai,&gt;&gt; hinda bu yaje na suwa nibui na Hwinsu u ansege pa aco a kwadwo, ai bu cagaga. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Zwama pa itano i suwa nibui aba bu kimga na Hwinsu,hinda na uno nibui goo bu zwame hinda abu cagage. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage,&lt;&lt;Buna ka̠mu bu yaje na bware buza ihoge mu'eya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Zwama aza banbanci na buna busa buyahude na buna bui sa bayahude-Buca bu yaba buikan bu be bus Buca bu yaba bu ka̠mu hinda bu tane uno u burya̠ aco kanmu buna bu uga iziya i buba, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwame,&lt;&lt;Buna bu uga iziya I Hwinsu ai cagaga bo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Neya, hinda, aba ai ugan buna aba ai yajuwa na buba? Ta neya aba ai yaje na buna aba ai si tabuwa i hohe nabari u buba? Hinda neya aba ai hoge si buciyahya bui ia̠gu ga cikarigo ci buba? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Hinda neya aba ai zwamaga cikarigo sa ai cumanuwa abucuma? nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin, &lt;&lt;Ibuna i acuma i gyamace an a kole cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Yesu! <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama sa aco Izra'ila ka̠mu a yaje na cikarigo ci laco. Zwama acubago Hwinsu Ishaya i zwame, &lt;&lt;Buca bu yaba ganba bu yaje na cikarigo a cici?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Zwama haruni itanu soo si kurya pa ihugago i cicuma, hinda cicuma ci Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ama na ia̠ makabo: Kamahinda ai huguwa? A hoge, Zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci zwamage:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Ijumu i bicwarwa bya ba bi ese ka̠mu doone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">cikarigo ciba hinda ka̠mu doone.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Na genbo gupa ikabana: Aco Israila ai dakuwo? Musa ube u rwage i cane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Ne sana i hoge isibu icinge cina cisa azwaga a labe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">na sana i dabe suwa na cinge cina ci sa aco hatagumo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Hinda acubago Hwinsu Ishaya i ia̠ koce u soo hal bware bu hin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Aco na ai na ginbaguwa abe an juka; na silta aco na aza na ginbaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">nai cibaga icwa numui pa aco na ai na kabanuwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ama aco Israila bware bu hyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;&lt;Ihunrumu ka̱mu na cukane wa nimui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">pa aco na za ilagano na ihugago i cikarigo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Yama Hwinsu pa Israila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Na ia̠ makabo: Hwinsu u wonje aco ba? Aye ko cimu! Gya na icwa nimui nisa buco bu Israila, azwaga a Ibrahim, hinda azwaga a Bayami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Hwinsu ui wunjuwa aco u ba ana uba tanga tun na jigu. I daki ina cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen cina acuma a Hwinsu Iliya iba zwamage game na Israila cina ci gyamacuwa: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Hwinsu, u hune acuma hinda a hacigage simama a muginga a mabui; Gyamui na gane hinda a yiwa ma na ginbo a na hone&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Hinda bai Hwinsu uba cane ga? &lt;&lt;Na ma gane aco dubu utandarya an ai laganuwa Hwinsu u cibya Ba'al.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Harbuni hinda nawuya, baniya aza aco cimu na gane an Hwinsu uba tanga zwama yama uba. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Itangano ini uba isa zwama yama i Hwinsu, sa zwama ibwana ya ba; sa wasa zwama ibwana i aco ba ia̠, yama i Hwinsu iza sana yama. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />To neya? Aco Israila ai hyinwo ina aba ginbage, azwaga a noya an Hwinsu uba tanga abe a hin ini. Aco menwa a zwapage hacube haba pa ugo u Hwinsu, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage:&lt;&lt;Hwinsu u pan ga mukoko na hasuwa ha nagu u cidaka, haisa han aba za i hya na hacube han aba za i hoge hal kuro u baniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Hinda Dauda aba hin: &lt;&lt;A konbe ga̱ na kaciba, a tane mare ma ba maga̠ri, i san nga̱ a hoge sunguro zwama nagu ihogo yaba. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Curya haisa haba ha ruba hal ha mayage na hyanaga, hinda hal abe aba a kuki na wahala una uza ihogu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cago aco na aisa hayahudawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Na gope i kaban:Inga hayahudawa hab magenje a i ginjo una uza wasa u ia̠gu eewo? Ko cimu! kwa di, zwama magwata̠ maba ucago u kore aco na ai sa Hayahudawa zwama a san Israila i dabe soo. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Magwata̠ ma Hayahudawa ma kole i burya̠ na doone, hinda nagu u koce waba u kole albarka pa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa, neya i burya̠ aba ai yana sa moso u Hayahudawa u sinji ka̠mu! <verse eid="ROM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Na yiwa na ia̠gya aco na ai sa Hayahudwa cikarigo.Tun nga̠ gya na sa almajiri a aco na ai sa Hayahudawa, na ia̠ cikibi na ibwana nimui <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kila na haruni na san aco nimui Israila a hoge isibu hal a cagage cagiya aco. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Zwama sa iwonjo ina aba wonje ga i sana yina a ikimgano yaba na Hwinsu na doone, hona aba ka̱ri i ca ga sa ihinwu a̠huru pa aco kwadwo buni wa kole? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Sa pan Hwinsu ikinda i burodi, una u gane u sa u ba; sa pan Hwinsu uganda, habwabo hasa ha uba hinda. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Sa gunji habwabo ha u'on u zaitun una aba bire, sa a zangi u'on una ui sa yaba, hal aba pala ga cigya, ga̠hin buna isa Hayahudawa isa nga̠ u'on u zaitun u hila, ga̠hi aba ai gami na Hayahudawa una pa ba ga̱hi i yiwa na hyan i burya̠ pa Hwinsu, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />ta ia̠ cikibi zwama habwabwa. Sa bu ia̠, da an: Bu za na itaimaka haganda, ama haganda habe ha yiwa na bu bangana. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ama bu pwa i, &lt;&lt;Habwabwa ha ma bose zwama a ganmi na ipicu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Usa kamahinda. Agunji ga zwama nagu u itano soo ya ba, goo bu yiwa payi zwama itano i soo nibui ibe ga̱hi i ma ga̱mi na upicu.Ta ia̠ cikibi, ama huga iwasa. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Sa Hwinsu ui curu habwabwa han hasa ha jigu, goo ma u za na bu curya. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Pini ci pwan i hyan nga̠ Hwinsu uba za yama na ubwobo u soo: Ubobo u suwa pa aco na hene, hinda yama pa goo, wata sa bu re gaba na dala pa yama uba. Ko nabe, goo ma ai bu gunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Hinda sa Hayahudawa ha curi nagu u itano soo i haba, zwama Hwinsu u pwan i ringage han ha san ipicu. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />ga̱i buna i sa Hayahudawa, i nyaga nga̠ u'on u zaitun u hila, una sa gunji on a ga̱mi cigya na una usa u yaba, hayahudawa ha nyaga na zaitun u yaba, hinda u za i hoge Hwinsu wahala a gupe gami cigya na u'on u zaitun una aba gunji na habwabo ha u'on uni!<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yama hwinsu pa aco ka̱mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ahun nimui, na ka̱ruwo i yan na nagu u cidaka u cishin cini, ahun namui, zwama ita zanga sicwa a sihin isa aco mahansa: Daru u soo u Israila ui ka̠ru isa una uza ihogu, ama ui yana hal hon na aco na ai sa yahudawa a kore pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Hinda harbuni Israila ka̠mu aba ai cagaga ga, nga̠ aba zwamage na cikarigo ci Hwinsu: &lt;&lt;Buna bui cagaga bui sirya na Sihiyona; bui acika nagu ui lagano i Hwinsu i azwaga a Yakub.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Hinda na ia̠ kucuna kuni na ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">sa na zangacu magwata̱ ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Inga aba wonje cikarigo ci burya̠, Hayahudawa ha sano an ai ka̱ruwo Hwinsu zwama aco na ai sa hayahudawa, ama zwama itangano i Hwinsu, a sa si 'osa sa Hwinsu zwama bacaca haba, <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />zwama Hwinsu uza i saka suwa u ba pa daje buna uba tanga na buna uba tane uno u burya̠. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />ga̠hi buna i sa Hayahudawa i laganowa Hwinsu na jigu ama baniya i hin yama i Hwinsu zwama Hayahudawa ha wonje i lagana Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Harbuni hinda zwama yama na ga̱hi i hin Hayahudawa baniya ha za i lagana Hwinsu nga̠ aba ma ai hyan yama Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Zwama Hwinsu u sano aco nga̠ a yiwa na bursuna u nagu u i lagano i Hwinsu yaba nga̠ uba ui ciba ga yama ka̠mu.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izangacu i Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Na biya, aba ai gama mahansa ma muso u Hwinsu! ganba bu pwana da suwa u ba, ganba bu da yina a Hwinsu! <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage, &lt;&lt;Ganba bu daki suwa u Hwinsu? Ganba bu pwana i pan Hwinsu shawara? <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />&lt;&lt;Ganba bwa tabo i pan Hwinsu ihya hal uba ui sana on dole u ringage bo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Zwama tibai ka̠mu Hwinsu ube u ia̠. Cizangacu ci sa ci uba cina ci za ihogu! Harbuni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Sadaka u burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Zwama haruni, si'usa a simui, ni yiwa na i ona, zwama yama i Hwinsu, i cuta hakanga a hanhi sadaka a burya̠ , uni ube usa ilagano i Hwinsu i kamahinda-ina Hwinsu uba ginbo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ita lagana iri ina doone uba ginbo, ama yada je Hwinsu ui sake hasuwa a hahin.Na harbuni ga̠hin i pwana i daki ina Hwinsu uba ginbo-ina isa burya̠ na ina uba ginbo na hinda ina i sinji. <verse eid="ROM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Zwama yama na Hwinsu uba pan na yiwa na zwamaga ta ganga: ta zanga icwa nebo nga̠ go bu ginbo, ama zanga icwa nebo boi sa ihya, wata zangi icwa nebo daidai na yajo ina Hwinsu uba bu pan. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ci za hasala dinya na kanga a haci, hinda tinba usala na ibwana i ba. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />harbuni hinda, ko nga̠ gaci ci mose ama cisa buikan na Kristi, hinda ci maganmi na hakanga a haci han ha yiwa dinya. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Aza ha daje dinyiya, tunba nga̠ Hwinsu uba sa ci pan i burya̠. Sa daje una u Hwinsu uba pan buco usa bu cubage cicuma ci Hwinsu, bu ia̠ nga̠ iyajo i suwa u buba pan bo. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Si u sa bu ia̠ ibwana; sa usa icibago, cibaga; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />sa usa ipangano ishawara, curya̠ ci san aco pangano i shawara; sa usa itaimaku i cagiyaco, pangana na suwa uikan; sa usa ibwana i cilabe, ia̠ cilabe suwa uikan; sa usa i hogo i yama, ia̠ na soo u cene.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanlo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ukamace maka̠la̠ a mahin masa ma kamahinda. Wondaje ka̱mu ina isa iwo; ama kumgaga je ina isa i burya̠ na koce. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />maka̠la̠ngi je nga̠ aco na sa alagano hinda i cimgagi i ma pan cilabe. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ia̠je ibwana na sicwa a sihin ita sa harogo, lagana je Hwinsu na hasuwa a hahin dinyiya. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />San je itano i soo nihin i san i wa̠wo, i ia̠ hankuri pa wahala una u ga̠hi i ese, hinda i hina na ia̠ ahunda̠ tohonba. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mahabsage izana ina i ga̱hin i za pa alagano na za ihya. I hina na ca hanyagata. <verse eid="ROM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Tana je aco na yiwa na pan wahala uno u burya̠ ; zwama Hwinsu u tane ga uno u burya̠ maka̱la̱ ita tana ga uno uwo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Saman na aco na yiwa na laco; ia̠ cidaro na aco na yiwa na cidaro. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ma dale na burya̠ na tiganba. ta ia̠ irugu, ama ia̠ kokari i ginbage i madale na aco na aba ai zanguga asa ihya. Ita zanga sicwa a sihin nga̠ i zake aco na mahansa. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Sa buco bui ia̠gi mogota, ita macupa na mugota. Ia̠ kokari i ia̠ ina aco ba hyan isa i burya̠ . <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ia̠je kokari i madale na tiganba, lapiya. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ta ma cupa sa abu ia̠gi eewo, sa'osa a simui sina gya na ka̠ri, ama curya ubobo u suwa u Hwinsu u bu cupe, nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage: &lt;&lt;Gyamui nasa buna bui ia̠ kucupo; Hwinsu u hin,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Sa harbuni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage: &lt;&lt;Sa buna bui ka̠ruwo muhyanu a mabui bu hoge imero, pan bo mare; sa bu hoge cu'oi, pan ga ihya a so. i ia̠wu i haruni i sana bu ce ula u mu'eya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ita curya magwata̠ mu siji icwa nibui, ama curya i burya̠ so icwa nihin.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">I lagano aco labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Tiganba bu laga aco labe doone, zwama aza aco labe an sa Hwinsu ube u iri ga. Hinda ka̠mu aco labe na yiwa na gwamnati Hwinsu ube u iri ga. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Buna bu wonje i lagana aco labe na yiwa zata u mudaluwo mu ibwana i aco labe doone bu yagage ina Hwinsu uba hyen na laga,buna bu ia̠ haruni bu kulage icwa i buba shara'a si Hwinsu na sicwa saba. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Zwama aco na kumgage mudalo mu labe ai sa i iwasa musanman aco na a ia̠gu i burya̠ , kwa di aco na ai ia̠wo i burya̠ .Bu ginbo curi iwasa buna bu za koce hinda bu yiwazata u idalo i cugwama? Ea ina sa burya̠ hinda ai bu yabana. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Zwama busa bugyama bu Hwinsu bu burya̠ .Ama sa bu ia̠ ina i sa burya̠ , huga iwasa, zwama sa kanmui buco bu labe buba kumgage kasakari i pano i wahala.Busa bugyama bu Hwinsu, hinda pa buba Hwinsu uba ui sungula aco iwo. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Zwama haruni, usa dole i laga aco labe na yiwa gwamnati,sa zwama Hwinsu ui pan sungula ama zwama hasuwa a hanhin ha cibe iza magwata. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ube u san ga̠hin i cupago ganju, zwama aco labe gwamnati asa gyama Hwinsu, an ai pan kanmu kuce waba paibwana cugwama. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Cupa tiganba ina buba yiwa na bu lagana: sa bu lagano ganju, cupa;ko musare mu atakada ai icwana, cupa; sa usa ihogo iwasa, hoga iwasa; sa usa cilabe, pan cilabe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ina kamace aco ma egyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ita kumgaga biwonbe bi buciyahya, kwa di utase maka̠la̠ ma sicwa a sihin, zwama buna bu ka̱ri kacagiya ka buba bu laga icibago i Musa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Cikarigo cina ci hyen,&lt;&lt;Buza ginbaga bu'a bu buco,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ta huna buco,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ta ia̠ ihya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ta ia̠ kwadiyin ina isa buco bu mewa,&gt;&gt; sa aza ci cage cikarigo, a ganmi ca cikarigo cina ci hyen:&lt;&lt;maka̱la̱ kacagiya a kabo nga̠ icwa nebo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Sa bu ka̱ri aco mewa, buza ia̠gya ga ina isa eewo. Zwama haruni maka̠la̠ masa i siju i icibago ci Musa. <verse eid="ROM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ea je harbuni zwama i daki iri dala na ga̠hi yiwa.Lokaci u iu una ga̠hin i masenga pa malabo, zwama icago ina aba ai ci ia̠gya i zake yabutan na hon na gaci laga Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Gita a karo i hargage; ubugwa u karo i bonge.Ci curi i ia̠gu ina isa nga̠ aco ci'incu ci mu bwada icwana i gasa i cingero. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ci ia̠ dala ana asa a burya̠ , nga̠ aco na yiwa na cingero, sa tare na swage-swage, sa na cidana na ginbe ginbe, ko ihuna na isibu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ama, zanga icwana i gasa i Yesu Kristi, hinda ta yada na dala a i doone ina i kula i ia̠gu i eewo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ta ia̠gya buciyahya shara'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Ca je buco buna i iyajo i buba i hogo kuce, ama i ta pana bo gwata si ihoge cikarigo ci suwa u buba ui sa uikan na nuhin. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Aza buco buna suwa u buba u yaje bo bu re tebai, ama bucagiya, buna iyajo i buba i hogo koce,bu yaje bu re alaipu kawai. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Buna bui re tabai buta ia̠gya buna buza re mare trt timanba,hinda buna bu suwa u buba uba ui yajuwa bu re tibai buta yagaga buna buza re, zwama Hwinsu u co bo. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Go busa ganba go bui ia̠gya bugyama bu buco bu mewa shara'a? Ko bu ia̠ i burya̠ ko iwo usa ina i hacigaga buca bu yaba buba suwa. Ai jidana bo koce bu yisa, zwama Hwinsu ube ui sana bo ia̠ nasara. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Bucagiye buco busa ucage hon na laco ucage; hinda ui lacumo, acagiya hon hinda usa uikan.Tiganba bu yaje na suwa u buba. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Kanmu buna bu zangi ucagiya hon u zake ucagiya bu ia̠ harunizwama i zangacu i Hwinsu.Aco na a re mare hya a ia̠ zwama i zangacu i Hwinsu zwa bu goji Hwinsu;hinda buna wonje re, bu ia̠ haruni zwama Hwinsu bu pan Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ciza na dala a sicwa a sici hinda aza buna bui kwaji zwama icwa i buba. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Si yiwa, ci yiwa zwama Hwinsu, si ci kwaji ci kwaji zwama Hwinsu.Ko ci kwaji ko ci yiwa cisa bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Zwama Kristi a kwaji zwama aco na kwajuwo na aco na a kwajo. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />ga̠hi buna i ryago alaipu kawai- san ga̠hi i yiwa na ia̠gya aco mewa? Go hinda buna bu ryago tibai bai i san go yagage acage alagano? Ka̠mu nuci Hwisu ube ui ci ia̠gya shara'a. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hin: &lt;&lt; &lt;Nga̠ gya na yiwa,&gt; Hwinsu hin, &lt;Tiganba ka̠mu bui na kuztan; tanba a̠re ai zwame na gya na sa Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Tiganba bui pana lisapi u icwa i buba pa Hwinsu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta sana cagiya aco ma juboce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ci curi ia̠gya cagiya aco shara'a.Maimako, ama ia̠ kokari ta sana ina i sana buco bu ma juboce ko ina i sana buhun bu ia̠ magwata. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />I lagano nimui na Buca bu yaba Kristi i sanuwa gya hyan ti maba mare masan i wo.Ama buna bu hyen aza ina mare mana masa iwo, pa buba masa iwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Sa ina go boi re i sana kacagiya a kabo suwa u siri, buza na maka̠la̠ na suwa u buba. Ta sana zwama i na goo bu yiwa ne re hone buhun a boba buna Kristi aba koji zwama goo. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ta yada ina go bu zangi isa burya̠ i marengiya isa iziya i wo. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Zwama cigwama ci yaba Hwinsu cisa ire i mare na ciso,ama usa i burya̠ ,dala a burya̠ , na laco una ahurun a Hwinsu aba pangano, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Hinda buna bu yiwa na lagana yina a Kristi bu yiwa na sana Hwinsu suwa cene,hinda aco a yaje na buba. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Zwama haruni ci kokori ci ia̠ ina i kole dala a burya̠ na jidano koce hawungrumi ma cagiya aco. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ita hacigaga ibwana i Hwinsu zwama mare ci re.Ui sa u burya̠ go i re ina i san kacagiya kabo ka ia̠ magwata. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />U gyamace go ta rya munegwa ko i so miya ma innabi ko goo ia̠ ihya ina isan a cage alagano a hene. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Curya ina i yiwa na suwa nobo i yan na go na Hwinsu. I burya̠ isa i buco buna suwa u buba ui panuwa bo laipi ina soo u buba u hyan i sa i burya̠ . <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama buco buna bu yiwa na hasuwa harya pa mare mana buba yiwa na re, zwama cire ci buba ciza itano i suwa;hinda ina iza itano i suwa isa magwata̱.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">San aco mewa so u cene sa icwa nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Gaci buna ci hoge koce na iyajo u gyamace ci banga aco na ai hogowa koce ina i dame ga, usa nga̠ gaci, cita sana sicwa a sici laco. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ina gaci ci ia̠ ci ia̠ ina i san cage alagano huge na burya̠ , zwama ci sa a hoge koce iyajo yaba. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Zwama Kristi na icwa yaba ai panuwa icwa yaba laco, nga̠ cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba zwamage:&lt;&lt;Cico cina aba egyi ci maringe a cimui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kanmu ina aba hinlage na cikarigo ci Hwinsu a ia̠ zwama aci cibage,nga̠ gaci ci tana suwa zwama duro u suwa una gaci ia̠ hinda na koce u hawungurumi u gaci hyin pa cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Hwinsu un pan duro u suwa u ga̠hi i lagana, uci pan dala burya̠ na suwa u Almasihu Kristi, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Inga ga̠hi i yana na suwa uikan pa izangacu i Hwinsu na bicwaro bikan zwama hyen daukaka Hwinsu na Buca bu Yesu Kristi Buca abuci, na hinda buci bware, nupi ci san iluka<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikarigo ci laco pa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Zwama barbuni cimo ceya yan'uwa siwa sire sirer, nga̠ Yesu Kristi ba chiya si wa sire-sirer, Zwama daukaka bware, (Hwinsu). <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Na yiwa dai na zwama gana Kristi sa bara isra'ila zwama wuyi chibawa kamahinda Hwinsu zwama tabbatar na alkawara uba ana uba egyi hakakanin kakanin hacho, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Zwama aco na ai sa Hayahudawa i pan Hwinsu cilabe zwama yama yaba nga̠ aba rubuci na cikarigowo ci Hwinsu:<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Har wa yau a hin, &lt;&lt;Gahin al'umma Hwinsu, hyenana ja na eyi wa wun tare na jama'a uba.&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Na hinda, &lt;&lt;ci mo yabe Hwinsu gaci al'ummai kamu. Duka siren si yabe Bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ishaya hinda hyen, &lt;&lt;Tsatson Yesse uyi bayyane. buna bo masaga bu mallaki Kristi. Pa bware al'ummai aba a tana suwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Hwinsu na sa kulleya tanu soo wai tsinge na wa̱wo na za yaka na salama nga̠ ga̠hi i yiwa na tani soo nuhin, zwama yi matukar itane soo na ikon wa hurun barya̱. <verse eid="ROM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Gya yan'uwa nuhim, na amince na ruhoto nuhin ga ma kuba i sinji na i burya̠ na kamahinda, aco na sinji na madaka̠, hinda isa ia̠gi ahun gagardi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Kama na harbuni ci cage kare goo na ruhuto nu ci, na jeda na karfafa kwarai zwama tunani na hin, hinda na i burya̠ Hwinsu uba ci ia̠gi. <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />Uba tana gya bugyama Kristi Yesu u pa al'ummai, gye na hye hidima cikargwa Hwinsu, zwama al'ummai asa hadaya iyi cewa pa bware, ina za cire yi ka hurun bware. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Hinda kuwa, na za dalili wuyi aitakama na almasihu Yesu game na al'amari Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Na za eyi kuskure zwame ihi, kadi ina Kristi ba iyi a pami, una san al'umma biyayya pa cikargwa ci bware na bona buba, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Pa iko mu'uji zai na ia̠gu al'ajabi hinda pa ikon wa hurun, har ma daga urushalima. na kewaye wu ba, haka kuro ilirikun, na eyi wa'azi Kristi ko tuhunba. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Har na sanar iyi burya̠ na sana ge iyi wa'azi pa ba tabuwa eyi na ziya Yesu Kristi, zwama ghye wa'azi na ma ina aba rigena a iyo harsashi, <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ka di nga̠ uba yiwa a hye &lt;&lt;achona na uba tabuwa pana labari abiya ai tabuwa hugo labari bware ma, ai gane.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="ms">BULUS IYI SHIRI KURO ROMAWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ubiya san lokaci dinyiya na hyen wo dai dai kurwo ahwahin. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ba niya aza huge na ge na ga ne na yan ke nuhin, haske kara dinyiya ge na iyi kokare kurwo hihin, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Na tani suwa ge na hinan lokaci kuro cinge ca asbaniya, halla ma ina shiha kurwo wa huyi, bayan gena ma zagwa kewa nuhin nga̠ ghe na yinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ama baniya kam, na kure urushalima, zwama ge kulagega gudunmawa. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Acho makidoniya na Akaya a huge lacho dai dai gwargwado pa gajiyayyu suwa urushalima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Hinda huge dai dai, zwama hyen nga̠ utasi na si cho saba, zwam al'ummai a yitarayya na ba na kan ni'ima waba na huruharbuni kwa, u kamace gaci ma ci taimake na ni'imarsuta doone. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Tsina hugo una, na danka ga sadaka una lapiya, gya laga kuro cinge Asabaniya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Na daki sina kure a hwahin, na palala albarka Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ama na yiwa na ai roko nuhin ahun na ziya buce bucho Yesu Kristi, na maka̠la̠ ma hurun ba pan, ina taimake na hunde pa Hwinsu zwama cho nimo, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ia̱ ahunda Zwam gya hyan icagagu pa aco na a wonje laga cikarigo ci Hwinsu na usala u Yahudiya, zwama gudunmawa una gya na kule urushalima usa ina aco nagu ciri aba ai ce. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Hinda Hwinsu uyaja huca hoba na soo cine, kamo ci mohoge laco. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Hwinsu una panganu salame u yan tare na ga̱ci duka. Harbuni.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="ms">Ubugago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Kurwo pa buhun nuci pibi na yiwa sada ga̠hi ne ba na hidima ikilisiya ina yiwa kankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ici an ain wa bire-bire zwama Hwinsu, na halin dace tsarkaka hinda taimake yan na irin una ba gimbago taimako hohin zwama uba ma taimake acho dinya harma hage. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Isani Bilkisu na Akila, siboki si bona Almasihu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Hinda si pa sihuru saba zwama gya, sa gyagya na yiwa ia̠gi godiya, halle ma na ikilisiyoyi hane gata. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Hwinsu sani ikilisiyar na matana ganu na haba. i sa ni acho ma ka̱la̱ ce Abainitas, ana biya sa pare ilagami Kristi na cinge Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />I soni maryamu mana mai ia̠gi bona kwarai na gaske. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />I bungi Andaronikus na Yuniyas, ahun, si usa daurina, sinasa sasi shahararru na, Suwa silmajiri, harma ana zwari ge na uriganan Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />I sani Amfiliyatus, buco ma ka̱la̱ mamu na ziya Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />I sani Urbanas, a'usa a ibwana na soo u Almasihu, hinda na a'usa nimui buna bu gya na ka̠ri Sitakis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Hinda i bungi Afalis, amintacen nimui na soo u Almasihu buna aba tabaci na bware. Hinda i bungi alagano ana sa aco yaba Aristobulus. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />I bunge buhun nimui Hirudiyan buna buba ma busa Bayahude. I bungi aco na yiwa na suwa Hwinsu ana sa aco yaba Narkisus. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />I sani tarapina natarapusa acho bona Hwinsu, i sani Barsisa, ina maka̠la̠ mamu, ina iyi bona Hwinsu kwarai na gaske. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />I sani rupas, wa riwa pita na urega nai, Hwinsu, na mace buba, na mu hinda. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />I sani Asinkiritus na piliguna, na Hermes, na Paturobas, na Harmas, na hinda ahun una yiwa tare na aba. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />I sani pilulugusa, na yuliya, na Niriya, na buhun ba, ulumpas na kamu wa aco nagu ciri ana yiwa tare na ba. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />I sanga ahun nagu ciri na sumba. Na duka ikilisiyoyin Kristi kamu a yiwa na sanganan. <verse eid="ROM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Na yiwa ai roko, ahun, I haukace pa cho na kokari ai rabitsakani, wani cibagwa sabanin, na tana iyi maju buta. I miriyan pa ba. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ai iri wa ba aza pan Buca bu yaba Kristi, kamu kaba moba. U roon hacube na laco nu aba yiwa ci yandaura aco na za sauki sicho. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ama ga̠hi kamai, tagan bu daki biyayya nuhi, ubiya san gena yiwa na murna ga̠hi. Na ginbagwa gwamance ina si burya̠, ama sa ba ruwan nuhi na mugunta. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Hwinsu na pangana dala a burya̠ hinda wai punda bugwama bu eewo, hinda bu pan koce pa uba, sa ni isanu, i burya̠ u Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu nuci a yan na ga̠hi. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, a'usa nimui, a yiwa na sangana harbuni hinda Lukiyas na Yason na hinda Sosifata, ahun nimui. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Gya Tarkiyas, ma rubuce ma wasika nan, na sanganan zwama Hwinsu. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus, umasauki mamui, bware hinda bu kazigiyan ikilisiya a yiwa na sanganan an.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erastus, buna busa bu ilagu bu i'ogo hinda na buhun nuci Kwartus a yiwa na bungagu. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />I burya̠ Hwinsu nuci Yesu Kristi u yan na ga̠hi (Amin). Harbuni .<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="ms">CHI HUGE NA MURNA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Izangacu i yan pa Hwinsu buna buza koce bu maisi ga̠hi yinsa na suwa wui itano soo pa ijumu i cikarigo ci laco uce una gya na yiwa na ia̠ numa zwamo Yesu Kristi. Ijumu i cikarigo ci laco uce a swami nya̠ tun na jigu <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Asirin na baniya a yiwa bayani waba, hinda eyo sanar wa ba pa al'ummai ta wurin littatafan acubago Hwinsu, bisa umurni Hwinsu una uza ihogu, zwama akuleyaga pa gaskiya, a iyi biyayya. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Dan kaka utabbace una za iyaka (har abada) pa Hwinsu makadaici u hikima Yesu Kristi Harbuni, harbuni. Amin, Amin.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>